        80.59070587158203,
        527.6303100585938,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "decentralization applies to the district hospital (first referral level hospital) level and/or primary health",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.991296768188477,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.6116943359375,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "care level and/or community level. Interventions for decentralization include capacity-building of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4113159179688,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "various cadres of health care workers, expanding access to diagnostic services, ensuring availability",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
