        70.86609649658203,
        154.984619140625,
        527.427978515625,
        169.53761291503906
      ],
      "text": "Differentiated HIV service delivery model:  Person-centred approach to simplify provision of HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.2946319580078,
        527.3792724609375,
        182.7376251220703
      ],
      "text": "services across the cascade in ways that better serve the needs of people living with HIV and reduce",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.49464416503906,
        269.0466003417969,
        195.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "unnecessary burdens on the health system.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        203.0885009765625,
        527.40283203125,
        217.64149475097656
      ],
      "text": "Drug susceptibility testing (DST):  In vitro testing using either molecular genotypic techniques",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        216.3986358642578,
        527.4321899414062,
        230.8416290283203
      ],
      "text": "to detect resistance-conferring mutations, or phenotypic methods to determine susceptibility to a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        229.59864807128906,
        118.20109558105469,
        244.04164123535156
      ],
      "text": "medicine. 2",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        251.1925048828125,
        527.4263916015625,
        265.7455139160156
      ],
      "text": "Extensive (or advanced) pulmonary tuberculosis disease:  Presence of bilateral cavitary disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        264.50250244140625,
        527.6278076171875,
        278.9455261230469
      ],
      "text": "or extensive parenchymal damage on chest radiography (CXR). In children aged under 15 years,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        277.7025146484375,
        485.2735900878906,
        292.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "advanced disease is usually defined by the presence of cavities or bilateral disease on CXR.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        299.29644775390625,
        317.15179443359375,
        313.8494567871094
      ],
      "text": "Extensively drug-resistant tuberculosis (XDR-TB) : 3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        204.16329956054688,
        318.31640625,
        328.15838623046875,
        335.4984130859375
      ],
      "text": "Mycobacterium tuberculosis",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.978729248046875,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.11041259765625,
        78.23609924316406,
        335.5534362792969
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        321.11041259765625,
        524.4785766601562,
        335.5534362792969
      ],
      "text": "Pre-XDR-TB: TB caused by   strains that fulfil the definition of multidrug-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.978729248046875,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        334.3103942871094,
        527.2265625,
        348.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "resistant TB (MDR-TB) or rifampicin-resistant TB (RR-TB) and that are also resistant to any",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        347.5104064941406,
        161.7723846435547,
        361.95343017578125
      ],
      "text": "fluoroquinolone. 4",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        188.5675048828125,
        357.91644287109375,
        256.2713928222656,
        375.0984191894531
      ],
      "text": "M. tuberculosis",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        360.7104187011719,
        78.23609924316406,
        375.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        360.7104187011719,
        527.4207763671875,
        375.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "XDR-TB: TB caused by   strains that fulfil the definition of MDR/RR-TB and that are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        373.910400390625,
        466.7646179199219,
        388.3534240722656
      ],
      "text": "also resistant to any fluoroquinolone and at least one additional Group A medicine. 5",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.50433349609375,
        527.4191284179688,
        410.0573425292969
      ],
      "text": "Extrapulmonary tuberculosis (EPTB) (classification):  Any bacteriologically confirmed or clinically",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        408.8143005371094,
        527.3981323242188,
        423.25732421875
      ],
      "text": "diagnosed case of TB involving organs other than the lungs (e.g. pleura, peripheral lymph nodes,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        422.0143127441406,
        368.6820068359375,
        436.45733642578125
      ],
      "text": "abdomen, genitourinary tract, skin, joints and bones, meninges). 6",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        443.60821533203125,
        527.3411865234375,
        458.1612243652344
      ],
      "text": "Family-centred, integrated care:  Family-centred models of care refer to interventions selected on the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.947977066040039,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        456.918212890625,
        527.4661865234375,
        471.3612365722656
      ],
      "text": "basis of the needs, values and preferences of the child or adolescent and their family or caregiver. This",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97983169555664,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        470.1181945800781,
        527.1807250976562,
        484.56121826171875
      ],
      "text": "can include health education, communication, material or psychological support. Integrated services",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.994749069213867,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        483.3182067871094,
        527.5887451171875,
        497.76123046875
      ],
      "text": "refer to approaches to strengthen collaboration, coordination, integration and harmonization of child",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.983838081359863,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        496.5182189941406,
        527.5503540039062,
        510.96124267578125
      ],
      "text": "and adolescent TB services with other child health-related programmes and services. This can include",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.977978706359863,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        509.71820068359375,
        527.526611328125,
        524.1611938476562
      ],
      "text": "integration of models of care for TB screening, prevention, diagnosis and treatment with other existing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969758987426758,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        522.918212890625,
        527.3990478515625,
        537.3612060546875
      ],
      "text": "service delivery platforms for maternal and child health (e.g. antenatal care, integrated community",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        536.1181640625,
        527.4266357421875,
        550.5611572265625
      ],
      "text": "case management, integrated management of childhood illnesses) and other related services (e.g.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.3182373046875,
        527.4091186523438,
        563.76123046875
      ],
      "text": "HIV, nutrition, immunization). Other examples include evaluation of children and adolescents with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        562.5181884765625,
        527.5504760742188,
        576.961181640625
      ],
      "text": "common comorbidities (e.g. meningitis, malnutrition, pneumonia, chronic lung disease, diabetes, HIV)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.971663475036621,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        575.7183227539062,
        527.4222412109375,
        590.1613159179688
      ],
      "text": "for TB and community health strategies integrating child and adolescent TB awareness, education,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        588.9183349609375,
        445.6197814941406,
        603.361328125
      ],
      "text": "screening, prevention and case-finding into training and service delivery activities.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        655.3333129882812,
        524.5281982421875,
        665.8372802734375
      ],
      "text": "Implementing tuberculosis diagnostics: a policy framework. Geneva: World Health Organization; 2015 (https://apps.who.int/iris/ 2",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        664.9332275390625,
        245.7843780517578,
        675.4371948242188
      ],
      "text": "handle/10665/162712, accessed 11 March 2022).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        677.367919921875,
        526.5010375976562,
        687.8718872070312
      ],
      "text": "Meeting report of the WHO expert consultation on the definition of extensively drug-resistant tuberculosis, 27–29 October 2020.  3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        686.9679565429688,
        524.3968505859375,
        697.471923828125
      ],
      "text": "Geneva: World Health Organization; 2021 (https://www.who.int/publications/i/item/meeting-report-of-the-who-expert-consultation-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        696.5679321289062,
        368.42498779296875,
        707.0718994140625
      ],
      "text": "on-the-definition-of-extensively-drug-resistant-tuberculosis, accessed 11 March 2022).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        709.0025024414062,
        526.3576049804688,
        719.5064697265625
      ],
      "text": "The fluoroquinolones include levofloxacin and moxifloxacin as currently recommended by WHO for inclusion in shorter and  4",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        718.6025390625,
        138.04469299316406,
        729.1065063476562
      ],
      "text": "longer regimens.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        731.0372314453125,
        526.524658203125,
        741.5411987304688
      ],
      "text": "Group A medicines are currently levofloxacin or moxifloxacin, bedaquiline and linezolid; therefore, XDR-TB is MDR/RR-TB that is  5",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        740.63720703125,
        526.5712280273438,
        751.1411743164062
      ],
      "text": "resistant to a fluoroquinolone and either bedaquiline or linezolid (or both). Group A medicines could change in the future. Therefore,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        750.2372436523438,
        416.4515380859375,
        760.7412109375
      ],
      "text": "the terminology “Group A” is appropriate here and will apply to any Group A medicines in the future.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        762.6718139648438,
        522.5365600585938,
        773.17578125
      ],
      "text": "Following a WHO expert consultation in September 2021, intrathoracic lymph node TB is now classified as pulmonary TB in children. 6",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
